Error [E0202]: Cannot write to `xs` — it does not have the write-access marker `&`; required before calling `.push()`
  --> read_param_method_write_fix.jet:2:22
    |
  2 | fn bad(xs: [Int]) { &xs.push(1) }
    |                      ^^
 Why: This method edits the value it's called on; the write-access marker `&` is required
 Fix: Change the parameter to `xs: &[Int]` and pass the argument with `&` at the call site
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0202
